THENCE (2) NORTH 87 DEGREES 07 MINUTES 30 SECONDS EAST ALONG THE NORTHERLY LINE OF PENNBROOK DRIVE, A DISTANCE OF 125.26 FEET TO AN ANGLE POINT;

THENCE (3) NORTH 56 DEGREES 40 MINUTES 00 SECONDS EAST ALONG THE NORTHERLY LINE OF PENNBROOK DRIVE, A DISTANCE OF 36.39 FEET TO A POINT AND CORNER/IRON PIPE;

