THENCE (5) SOUTH 18 DEGREES 06 MINUTES 50 SECONDS WEST ALONG THE DIVISION LINE BETWEEN LOT 11 AND LOT 12, SAID BLOCK, A DISTANCE OF 203.45 FEET TO THE POINT AND PLACE OF BEGINNING.

